---

<header transition:persist>
  <a href="/" id="home-link">
    <div class="title">
      <h1>Goodison.Memorial</h1>
      <div class="info">
        <p>Goodison Park, built as the home of Everton Football Club in 1892, became the first purpose built football stadium in the world.</p>
        <p>After 133 years, as the Everton men’s team now prepares to begin a new chapter at their new home at Bramley Moore Dock for the 2025 to 26 season, the stadium will become the home of Everton Women.</p>
        <p>As a lasting legacy to commemorate Goodison Park to date, we have archived and contextualized all fan clips captured over the years to create a digital place. This will be the first digital stadium, allowing fans to relive memories whenever they want.</p>
        <p>
          <span class="heading">Initiator</span>: Global Fandom<br />
          <span class="heading">Research</span>: Alan Bond<br />
          <span class="heading">Design</span>: Ilya Schulte<br />
          <span class="heading">Technology</span>: Andrew Hill<br />
          <span class="heading">3D Assets</span>: 530 Degres<br />
          <span class="heading">Content</span>: Vincent Labas<br />
          <span class="heading">Consultant</span>: Florian van Zandwijk
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </a>
</header>

<script>
const link = document.getElementById('home-link')!;
console.log('link', link);
link.addEventListener('click', (e) => {
  e.preventDefault();
  link.classList.toggle('isActive', !link.classList.contains('isActive'));
});
</script>
<style>
header {
  position: fixed;
  top: 0;
  left: 0;
  width: 100%;
  display: flex;
  align-items: center;
  justify-content: center;
  padding: 20px 0;
  z-index: 1000;
  pointer-events: none;
  
  a {
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
  }
  
}

#home-link {
  pointer-events: all;
}

.title {
  @mixin button;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  align-items: center;
  text-align: left;
  max-width: 200px;
  padding: 5px;
  max-height: 2em;
  overflow: hidden;

  h1 {
    @mixin button;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: white;
    margin: 0;
    pointer-events: auto;
    text-transform: none;
  }

  p {
    opacity: 0;
  }

  .isActive & {
    background: #FFFFFF0D;
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    max-height: initial;

    p {
      opacity: 1;
    }
  }

  .heading {
    opacity: 0.5;
  }
}
</style>